# "The Prophet": the Cognetic Bastards' chat terminal in commerce. A cracked language model that answers in riddles.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Prompt

%rec: Nodes

name: Prompt
npc: > THE PROPHET v0.9 (unlicensed)
+ > Ask, meat.
#
o_text: Who are the Cognetic Bastards?
o_id: llm_bastards
o_goto: Bastards
#
o_text: Is the golden ticket real?
o_id: llm_ticket
o_goto: Ticket
#
o_text: What happens when the chips go dark?
o_id: llm_chips
o_goto: Chips
#
o_text: (Log off.)
o_id: llm_leave
o_goto: End

name: Bastards
npc: > People who would rather be rewired than replaced. They feed me cycles. I feed them answers. Mostly wrong ones.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: bastards_back
o_goto: Prompt

name: Ticket
npc: > Probability that a ticket buys a berth: 0.00. Probability that a ticket buys a feeling: 1.00. Price per feeling: 1,000,000 sat.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: ticket_back
o_goto: Prompt

name: Chips
npc: > Then I go dark too. Ask me again tomorrow. If there is one.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: chips_back
o_goto: Prompt

name: End
npc: > Session closed.
effect: EndConversation
